              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rom 2:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kaany da lukatwak, lukapolok ka ludidik da, ebwoete koiŋaren keicoloŋ, kopukoroi iitabon. Kopukoroi eceitabo da, loerai loka aijar. Kotubokinai lukatwak kotoma ŋun kanuewadikatai oitabon kwape kejaatar aswamisiokec. ",
          "type": "text",
